{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24324","headline":"池上逐凉二首 一 · 白居易","name":"池上逐凉二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青苔地上消残暑，绿树阴前逐晚凉。\n轻屐单衫薄纱帽，浅池平岸庳藤牀。\n簪缨怪我情何薄，泉石谙君味甚长。\n徧问交亲爲老计，多言宜静不宜忙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}